sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Agent co-editing
  participant A as Agent
  participant M as MCP server
  participant D as Doc
  participant U as User
  A->>M: doc_insert_block(text)
  activate M
  M->>D: apply(edit)
  Note over D,U: Edit lands live in the open page
  loop while the user types
    U->>D: keystroke
    D-->>M: hold agent edits
  end
  D-->>M: ok
  deactivate M
  M-->>A: block_id
